OL,3,ATwo men admit sex offences in drugged  
OL,4,Awife case                              
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains         
OL,7,Fdistressing content                    
OL,9,FTwo men have pleaded guilty to sexual  
OL,10,Foffences against a woman who was       
OL,11,Fdrugged and raped by her husband       
OL,12,Fwithout her knowledge.                 
OL,14,FRobert Stewart, 70, from Stockport     
OL,15,Fadmitted rape and conspiracy to        
OL,16,Fadminister a substance with intent at  
OL,17,FManchester Minshull Street Crown Court.
OL,19,FIn a separate hearing at Manchester    
OL,20,FMagistrates' Court, Tommy Golden, 59,  
OL,21,Fpleaded guilty to sexual assault       
OL,22,Finvolving the same woman in June 2025. 
